{"id":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch01_Preliminaries#def:cut-time-locus","title":"def:cut-time-locus","path":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch01_Preliminaries.md","line":721,"body":"","kind":"definition","status":"not_started","tex":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch01_Preliminaries.tex#def:cut-time-locus","uses":["[[references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch01_Preliminaries#def:cut-time]]","[[references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch01_Preliminaries#lem:minimizing-downward-closed]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch01_Preliminaries.tex","label":"def:cut-time-locus","line":1861,"source":"\\begin{definition}[The segment domain, the cut locus and the injectivity radius, metrically]\n\\label{def:cut-time-locus}\n\n\\uses{def:cut-time, lem:minimizing-downward-closed}\n\n\n\n\nWith $c(v)$ as in Definition~\\ref{def:cut-time}, set\n$$U_p=\\{v\\in T_pM : c(v)>1\\},\\qquad\n{\\mathcal C}_p=\\{\\gamma_v(c(v)) : \\lvert v\\rvert_g=1,\\ c(v)<\\infty\\},\\qquad\n\\inj_M(p)=\\inf_{\\lvert v\\rvert_g=1} c(v).$$\nThese agree with the $U_p$, ${\\mathcal C}_p$ and $\\inj_M(p)$ of\nDefinitions~\\ref{def:cut-locus} and~\\ref{def:injectivity-radius}; that agreement is part of\nLemma~\\ref{lem:cut-locus-properties}.\n\\end{definition}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Definition</div></section>[The segment domain, the cut locus and the injectivity radius, metrically] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-6465663a6375742d74696d652d6c6f637573\"></span> <p></p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FMorganTian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh01_Preliminaries%23def%3Acut-time\">↗ def:cut-time</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FMorganTian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh01_Preliminaries%23lem%3Aminimizing-downward-closed\">↗ lem:minimizing-downward-closed</a> <p></p>With <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$c(v)$\">$c(v)$</span> as in Definition <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FMorganTian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh01_Preliminaries%23def%3Acut-time\" data-tex-node=\"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch01_Preliminaries#def:cut-time\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6465663a6375742d74696d65\">def:cut-time</a>, set <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\[ U_p=\\{ v\\in T_pM : c(v)&gt;1\\} ,\\qquad {\\mathcal C}_p=\\{ \\gamma _v(c(v)) : \\lvert v\\rvert _g=1,\\  c(v)&lt;\\infty \\} ,\\qquad \\inj _M(p)=\\inf _{\\lvert v\\rvert _g=1} c(v). \\]\">\\[ U_p=\\{ v\\in T_pM : c(v)&gt;1\\} ,\\qquad {\\mathcal C}_p=\\{ \\gamma _v(c(v)) : \\lvert v\\rvert _g=1,\\  c(v)&lt;\\infty \\} ,\\qquad \\inj _M(p)=\\inf _{\\lvert v\\rvert _g=1} c(v). \\]</span> These agree with the <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$U_p$\">$U_p$</span>, <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"${\\mathcal C}_p$\">${\\mathcal C}_p$</span> and <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\inj _M(p)$\">$\\inj _M(p)$</span> of Definitions <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FMorganTian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh01_Preliminaries%23def%3Acut-locus\" data-tex-node=\"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch01_Preliminaries#def:cut-locus\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6465663a6375742d6c6f637573\">def:cut-locus</a> and <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FMorganTian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh01_Preliminaries%23def%3Ainjectivity-radius\" data-tex-node=\"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch01_Preliminaries#def:injectivity-radius\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6465663a696e6a65637469766974792d726164697573\">def:injectivity-radius</a>; that agreement is part of Lemma <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FMorganTian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh01_